# NAME: 番茄小说
# Fanqie Novel routing ruleset for returning app traffic to a China policy.
# Usage:
# Place the adblock ruleset first, then this routing ruleset.
# RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mulanshan/surge/main/rules/fanqie-novel-adblock.list,REJECT,extended-matching
# RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mulanshan/surge/main/rules/fanqie-novel-cn.list,China,extended-matching
#
# Replace "China" with your China-return policy group. If you are in mainland
# China and do not need a proxy, use DIRECT instead.

# Fanqie core business and reading resources.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fqnovel.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fanqienovel.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fqnovelpic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fqnovelvod.com

# Dynamic resources and CDN hosts observed from iOS Surge logs.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bytegecko.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ydycdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,manlaxycloud.com

# ByteDance / Fanqie auxiliary resources observed from iOS Surge logs.
DOMAIN,gecko5-lq.zijieapi.com
DOMAIN,ma.zijieapi.com
DOMAIN,saveu5-normal-lq.zijieapi.com
DOMAIN,p11.douyinpic.com
DOMAIN,p3.douyinpic.com
DOMAIN,p26-item.ecombdimg.com
DOMAIN,p3-aio.ecombdimg.com

# Embedded commerce/live entrypoints seen during app navigation and global
# proxy testing. Keep these behind the adblock ruleset so confirmed ad/log
# domains are still rejected.
DOMAIN,ec3-core-lq.ecombdapi.com
DOMAIN,ec5-core-lq.ecombdapi.com
DOMAIN,ecom3-normal-lq.ecombdapi.com
DOMAIN,ecom5-normal-lq.ecombdapi.com
DOMAIN,isaas5-normal-lq.ecombdapi.com
DOMAIN,content-open.douyin.com
DOMAIN,webcast5-open-lq.douyin.com

# Exact snssdk / ByteDance auxiliary hosts seen during global-proxy testing.
# Avoid broad DOMAIN-SUFFIX,snssdk.com or bytedance.com because those families
# also carry unrelated app and ad traffic.
DOMAIN,aweme.snssdk.com
DOMAIN,tp-pay.snssdk.com
DOMAIN,vas.snssdk.com
DOMAIN,pitaya.bytedance.com
DOMAIN,vc-brain.ndcpp.com

# Observed ad/telemetry endpoint. If you also use the adblock ruleset, place it
# before this routing ruleset so this domain is rejected instead of routed.
DOMAIN,dig.bdurl.net
